{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["And these are the names of the chiefs of Esav by their clans, by their places — among these chiefs he mentions some of the chiefs stated above regarding the sons of Esav. And it may be said that in the end these latter ones became the principal ones, being chiefs of city after city, as it is written here: למקומותם [למושבתם] בארץ אחוזתם. And a proof for my words: all the perashot of the sons of Esav and the sons of Se'ir and the kings who reigned through the end of the entire perasha are written in Chronicles, whereas the first perasha of the chiefs of the sons of Esav is not mentioned there at all — only the chiefs of the second perasha alone."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {0 "The bracketed [למושבתם] appears to be a variant or gloss in the Hebrew text; retained as found."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:23.263405125Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}